SUMMARY:What Were You Thinking Of Darling?
DESCRIPTION:Laois Arthouse is delighted to announce a seven-week visual art workshop series for adults led by resident artist Lia Laimböck. Lia will be sharing her unique fabric collage process with participants\, inviting each participant to create two related works over the 7-week period. Using the theme “What were you thinking of darling?”\, Lia will guide participants to make a portrait in collage and to create a second connected work that reflects what the person or animal\, portrayed\, is thinking.
URL:https://laoistourism.ie/event/what-were-you-thinking-of-darling/
CATEGORIES:Member
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://laoistourism.ie/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Lia-Collage-Portrait-scaled.jpeg
END:VEVENT
