SUMMARY:Beginners Crochet Classes At Portlaoise Library
DESCRIPTION:Discover the joy of crochet with our 6-week Beginners Crochet Course at Portlaoise Library\, led by Courtney from LOETB. Perfect for complete beginners\, this friendly course will guide you through the basics of crochet in a relaxed and supportive environment. All you need to bring is a size 4 crochet hook and a ball of yarn.
URL:https://laoistourism.ie/event/beginners-crochet-classes-at-portlaoise-library/
