SUMMARY:Bootcamp with Malone Fitness
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun way to improve your fitness\, build strength\, and boost your confidence? Join Bootcamp with Malone Fitness\, a supportive 6-week programme designed for beginners and those returning to exercise. No matter your fitness level\, you’ll be welcomed into a friendly and encouraging environment where you can move at your own pace and achieve your goals.
URL:https://laoistourism.ie/event/bootcamp-with-malone-fitness/
CATEGORIES:Member
