SUMMARY:Pilates Programme with Sabrina
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate European Week of Sport by investing in your health and wellbeing with a welcoming 6-week Pilates programme in Portarlington\, led by Sabrina. Whether you are new to Pilates or have previous experience\, these classes are suitable for adults of all fitness levels. Pilates is a popular low-impact exercise that strengthens the body\, improves mobility\, and helps reduce everyday aches and pains.
URL:https://laoistourism.ie/event/pilates-programme-with-sabrina/
CATEGORIES:Member
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://laoistourism.ie/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/789594445_1371365127977123_8121455386403869317_n.jpg
