SUMMARY:Chair Yoga At Portlaoise Library
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Portlaoise Library for a four-week Chair Yoga programme as part of Positive Ageing Week. Chair Yoga is a gentle and accessible form of exercise that can help improve mobility\, flexibility\, strength and overall wellbeing. Using a chair for support\, participants will be guided through a series of movements and stretches suitable for a range of abilities.
URL:https://laoistourism.ie/event/chair-yoga-at-portlaoise-library/
CATEGORIES:Member
