SUMMARY:Avenue Q Hit Musical
DESCRIPTION:Four unforgettable nights of comedy\, music\, and mayhem as the Tony Award–winning musical Avenue Q brings its outrageous charm to the Dunamaise Arts Centre. Winner of the Tony Awards for Best Musical\, Best Book\, and Best Score\, Avenue Q is a smart\, cheeky\, and irresistibly funny musical that blends puppets\, people\, and pop-culture satire to tell a story about finding your purpose in a hilarious and very relatable way.
URL:https://laoistourism.ie/event/avenue-q-hit-musical/
CATEGORIES:Comedy,Member,Music
