SUMMARY:Imposter Art Exhibition
DESCRIPTION:We are thrilled to welcome multidisciplinary artist Taoiseach to Dunamaise Arts Centre for her debut solo exhibition. Imposter presents the imagined art collection of the Madame\, a character obsessively commissioning portraits of herself to construct an embellished legacy through historical portraiture and theatrical staging.
URL:https://laoistourism.ie/event/imposter-art-exhibition/
