SUMMARY:Shared Reading At Mountmellick Library
DESCRIPTION:Shared Reading at the library is where people connect\, and share experiences using stories and poems. There is no pressure to talk or read aloud. Shared reading exposes us to great and varied literature and allows us to discover more about ourselves and others.
