SUMMARY:80s & 90s Music Bingo Night
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a night of 80s & 90s hits\, big tunes & plenty of craic at The Railway Bar Portarlington. Players are given a bingo card where traditional bingo numbers have been replaced with song names. Your host DJ plays clips of music and you mark off spots on your bingo card.
