SUMMARY:Vittorio Angelone You Can’t Say Nothing Any More
DESCRIPTION:Vittorio Angelone is an Italian-Irish comedian from Belfast. He has accelerated through the comedy ranks at an anxiety inducing rate. Vittorio is also known for his chart topping podcast\, Mike & Vittorio’s Guide To Parenting with fellow comedian Mike Rice as well as co-creator of the online series\, Fin Vs The Internet.
