SUMMARY:The Roadhouse Doors At Kavanaghs Bar & Venue
DESCRIPTION:Ireland’s No. 1 Tribute to The Doors and Jim Morrison… The Lizard King. Take a trip back to the 1960’s L.A. music scene with us. All the Doors greatest hits and deep cuts authentically played in an electrifying live set. Is Everybody In?
