SUMMARY:Happy Hiking Hill Skills Day
DESCRIPTION:Mountaineering Ireland’s Happy Hiking Hills Skills Programme returns for its fifth year. These Hill Skills Days are a great opportunity for anyone new to the hills or those who want to learn the basics of navigation to join a qualified instructor for a full day’s training and to gain useful information and skills that will help keep you safe on the hills.
URL:https://laoistourism.ie/event/happy-hiking-hill-skills-day/
