SUMMARY:Kirtan Practice At Arunachala
DESCRIPTION:Come and explore the joyful\, heart-opening practice of Kirtan — the devotional singing of sacred chants and mantras. No singing experience is needed. You can sing\, play harmonium\, move with your body\, or simply listen and receive the benefits of the practice. We’ll gather in a beautiful\, peaceful setting\, with a delicious lunch included — a lovely opportunity to slow down\, connect and share in the joy of singing together.
URL:https://laoistourism.ie/event/kirtan-practice-at-arunachala/
CATEGORIES:Member,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://laoistourism.ie/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/796768107_17947829841299209_7348944580490374457_n-1.jpg
