SUMMARY:Bingo Loco At Midlands Park Hotel
DESCRIPTION:Looking for the ultimate party experience in the UK and Europe? Welcome to Bingo Loco — the interactive live event where a huge night out meets the madness of bingo. We’ve taken a classic game and flipped it on its head\, creating a full-blown party experience packed with DJs\, dance-offs\, lip-sync battles\, confetti showers\, outrageous prizes and unforgettable moments. This isn’t bingo as you know it… this is a party with a bingo twist.
URL:https://laoistourism.ie/event/bingo-loco-at-midlands-park-hotel/
