SUMMARY:Mick Creagh One Man Show
DESCRIPTION:Storyteller Mick Creagh from Laois will perform his one-man show at The Anvil Inn Portarlington. He’s an old-style storyteller with one eye on the past and one on the present. He enjoys getting his audience involved\, so clear your throats and be ready.
URL:https://laoistourism.ie/event/mick-creagh-one-man-show/
