SUMMARY:Abbeyleix Applefest 2026
DESCRIPTION:The  Applefest Apple Festival  is now an annual event (going for more than 10 years now) that takes place in the Community Garden on the first Sunday in October each year. All the fruit provided and used has been sourced from local orchards and gardens. Along with apple pressing from many varieties will be stalls and craft displays.
