SUMMARY:The Magnificent Interiors Of Emo Court
DESCRIPTION:Discover the Emo Court estate during an exciting tour in Ukrainian. A special tour with an OPW guide awaits you\, who will take you through the historic rooms and tell you about the past of one of Ireland’s most famous estates.
