SUMMARY:Assembly on Alcohol Harms
DESCRIPTION:Join community advocates\, researchers and local voices to explore solutions to alcohol-related harms and help shape future action. The Assembly is designed to be highly participatory\, using facilitated mixed-sector groups to develop practical\, evidence-informed recommendations . The overall goal is to co-produce actionable solutions that contribute to safer communities.
URL:https://laoistourism.ie/event/assembly-on-alcohol-harms/
