SUMMARY:Sensory Play At Portarlington Library
DESCRIPTION:The Sensory Play Session has been created to support children and young adults with disabilities\, additional needs\, and learning challenges\, along with their families. This jam -packed programme invites all to nurture their unique potential through a diverse range of art\, music and play therapy workshops.
