SUMMARY:The Shaking Bog Presents Riverine
DESCRIPTION:Riverine is a film that was produced by the Shaking Bog Festival\, a festival based in the Glencree Valley that celebrates the intersection where arts and nature meet. Directed by multi award winning director Alan Gilsenan\, Riverine celebrates and connects the diverse communities of both people and nature that populate the Dargle River Basin.
