SUMMARY:Introduction to Ayurveda
DESCRIPTION:Discover the timeless wisdom of Ayurveda in this interactive three-evening course at Arunachala Ayurveda Rejuvenation Centre. Whether you’re completely new to Ayurveda or looking to deepen your understanding\, this course offers practical knowledge you can begin using in everyday life. Spaces are limited. Book early to reserve your place
