SUMMARY:Weaving And Nature Print Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join Ailbhe Joyce from Laois Forest School for a weaving and nature print workshop. In this hands-on workshop\, use leaves\, flowers and other botanical materials to create unique prints on paper and fabric. Discover how different plants\, natural tannins\, preparation and printing processes can produce surprising results.
