SUMMARY:Sketchbook Club At Portlaoise Library
DESCRIPTION:Planning on applying to a third level art program next year and need to work on your sketchbook for the portfolio submission. All levels of skill welcome materials provided but you’re welcome to bring your own. Visits from working artists and themed drawing challenges. Come along and meet fellow scribblers and doodlers swap tips and tricks.
